 "Modelos 3D: Reloj — Model and textures: Eric Chadwick (CC-BY-4.0); Khronos logo: Non-copyrightable logo (LicenseRef-LegalMark-Khronos); 3D Commerce logo: Non-copyrightable logo (LicenseRef-LegalMark-Khronos); DGG logo: Copyrightable logo (LicenseRef-LegalMark-DGG)": "Modelos 3D: Relógio — Model and textures: Eric Chadwick (CC-BY-4.0); Khronos logo: Non-copyrightable logo (LicenseRef-LegalMark-Khronos); 3D Commerce logo: Non-copyrightable logo (LicenseRef-LegalMark-Khronos); DGG logo: Copyrightable logo (LicenseRef-LegalMark-DGG)",
